      },
      "description": "How to read the chart: lower line = faster team. If baton 2's line crosses below baton 3's, that's the moment baton 2 starts being the faster team over a sustained window — a good signal of an overtake in progress. The 25th percentile specifically tells you about each team's good laps rather than their typical pace, which can be an earlier signal than the median: a team often shows their better laps before their average catches up.",
